msgid "Enable Basic Authentication"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Enable the Basic Authentication for your Quarkus project and allow users to "
"authenticate with a username and password."
msgstr ""

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You have installed at least one extension that provides an "
"`IdentityProvider` based on username and password, such as xref:security-"
"jdbc.adoc[Elytron JDBC]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Procedure"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Enable Basic Authentication by setting the value of `quarkus.http.auth."
"basic` property to `true`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For a Basic Authentication configuration walk-through that uses `JPA`, see "
"the xref:security-getting-started.adoc[Getting Started With Security] guide."
msgstr ""

